+const generateEducationArticle = (tc) => `# Transforming Education: Cognitive Science, Adaptive Learning, and the Classroom of Tomorrow
+
+## Introduction
+Education is the engine of human civilizationΓÇöthe conduit through which collective knowledge, culture, and innovation are transferred across generations. Yet as technological disruption accelerates and global workforce demands shift, traditional 19th-century Prussian schooling modelsΓÇöcharacterized by rigid age cohorts, passive lectures, and standardized rote memorizationΓÇöare proving inadequate.
